    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuilding? what is there left to rebuild? i've lost the only version of myself that actually mattered. the version people respected. the version that had a purpose. now i'm just a cautionary tale for everyone else. it feels like the world has already moved on without me, and honestly, it feels more natural to just let it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
